1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,250
Narrator: Listen to a teacher talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:09,030
Teacher: It's that time of year again and the Talent Show process is in full swing!

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:13,040
Every year, students show off their amazing talents

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:17,010
making it one of the most popular events in the school.

5
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:20,020
Auditions will be taking place next week.

6
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,726
Sign-ups are up until Wednesday,

7
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:25,120
but do not wait until the last minute

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,230
as we used to receive a lot of complaints about failing to sign up.

9
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:34,060
So hurry up and contact your teacher about the event.
